      "entailment_verified": true,
      "evidence_type": "published tag insertion at this exact site",
      "extracellular": true,
      "functional_impact_measured": "Surface display of the N-terminally FLAG-tagged full-length receptor was used in cell-based assays (PMC3321182). The independent mouse knock-in (PMC11154861) confirmed immunolocalization of the endogenous 2xmyc-tagged Lphn1 at synapses, demonstrating surface trafficking of the tagged receptor in vivo. No quantitative functional assay result is reported for the FLAG construct alone in L4.",
      "gene_symbol": "ADGRL1",
      "insert_after_residue": 24,
      "library": null,
      "linker": null,
      "loop_run_position": null,
      "median_conservation": null,
      "numbered_against": null,
      "plddt": null,
      "position_evidence": "validated",
      "position_frame": null,
      "provenance": "literature_retrieved",
      "rationale": "L4 explicitly states 'The Flag epitope was fused at Leu25 of CL1', and the topology landmarks place the signal peptide at residues 1\u201324, making Leu25 (seq[24]='L') the first residue of the mature extracellular N-terminus. The tag therefore sits after residue 24 (seq[23]='G'), well upstream of TM1 (865), with 840 residues of extracellular space between the junction and the first TM helix. L7 independently pins the identical junction in the mouse ortholog knock-in, raising confidence that this terminus tolerates an epitope tag without disrupting folding or trafficking. Full-length human CL1 (ADGRL1/latrophilin-1) expressed in cells with a FLAG epitope fused at Leu25, the first residue of the mature protein after signal-peptide cleavage (SP = residues 1\u201324). The same N-terminal junction is independently corroborated by a mouse knock-in line (L7, PMC11154861) in which a 2xmyc tag was inserted 'just after the signal peptide and before the lectin-like domain', confirming the junction is conserved and tolerated in the endogenous receptor.",
      "residue_after": "L",
      "residue_before": "G",
      "residue_label": "G24",
      "residue_range": null,
